# Customer Churn Analysis
 
## Business Problem
 
A telecommunications company is experiencing customer churn and wants to understand why customers leave and what actions can improve retention.
 
## Objective
Analyse customer behaviour and identify factors contributing to churn.
 
## Dataset
 
IBM Telco Customer Churn Dataset
 
## Tools Used
 
- Power BI
- Excel

## Skills Demonstrated
 
- Business Analysis
- Customer Analytics
- Data Visualisation
- Problem Solving
- Business Intelligence
